  "details": "Tested on current live SDK 2021.05.04.16.01\nWhen you enter play mode in SDK3 there's always a warning about a missing script on the VRC_PlayerVisualDamage prefab. The prefab in question is located in VRCSDK > Dependencies > VRChat > Resources. This prefab is also redundant as there's a similar one in VRChat Examples > Prefabs.\nAttached picture is the warning in question.",
